# The API's address, used for production builds.
#
# Not a secret: it is a public URL, and Vite compiles it into the shipped
# JavaScript where anyone can read it. That is fine — the API is protected by
# tokens, not by its address being unknown. Never add a real secret here.
#
# Vite gives a real environment variable priority over this file, so a
# VITE_API_URL set in the hosting dashboard overrides this line. Delete it there
# if you want this to take effect.
VITE_API_URL=https://inoutportal-mod.onrender.com/api
